{"title":"도쿄 샨디 랑데부","artist":"MAISONdes","sourceId":"reference:HUXaxXjp6sp5WbOw8iGU","sourceHash":"cc60f6b55f88b56b6900fbeeb6d5fa2ce2982e6a84c5e3fbe6a2ffce177518c8","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":5.29,"end":8.29,"text":"電波テンポアップして絶賛感電中！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":14.27,"end":17.27,"text":"あなたにもわすれたいこと かなしいこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":18.8,"end":20.93,"text":"あるのかしらね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":20.93,"end":23.93,"text":"識らない映画なのに涙をながすのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":24.92,"end":27.92,"text":"ドラマチックが足りてないからよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":28.11,"end":31.11,"text":"そんな愚にも付かないこと くだらないこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":32.99,"end":35.01,"text":"考えてばかりね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":35.01,"end":38.01,"text":"雨が上がれば愛もその横顔も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":38.76,"end":41.65,"text":"誰かのものになるのでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":41.65,"end":44.65,"text":"嘘っぱちのファンデーションも全部今夜のためよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":45.95,"end":48.95,"text":"なのに一体全体 如何して如何して 何故何故 ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":49.56,"end":52.56,"text":"不安定なカンテラ 何処まで行くの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":53.08,"end":55.82,"text":"あなた一切合切放り去ってもう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":55.82,"end":58.12,"text":"冗談じゃあないないわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":58.12,"end":59.73,"text":"トウキョウ・シャンディ・ランデヴ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":59.73,"end":62.73,"text":"その時が来たって如何にもならないぜ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":63.78,"end":66.78,"text":"曖昧な本当なんてメランコリ化するだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":67.83,"end":70.8,"text":"あたしをさあ掻攫って今テイクオンミー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":70.8,"end":73.8,"text":"イェス","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":77.43,"end":79.33,"text":"はあ ちゃんちゃらおかしな法度ばっかで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":79.33,"end":80.89,"text":"食指がびくともしないわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":80.89,"end":83.07,"text":"実態の無い感情放っておいたって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":83.07,"end":85.75,"text":"策略なんてありゃあせんのに何故","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":85.75,"end":86.99,"text":"ああもう懲り懲りよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":86.99,"end":89.99,"text":"あたしの喝となる気質もじっと堪えて取り繕っては","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":90.03999999999999,"end":91.77,"text":"とうとう臨界点","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":91.77,"end":94.77,"text":"年がら年中リップサービス 鈍感カマしては辟易","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":95.36,"end":98.25,"text":"どんがらがっしゃんフィールガールは涙の目にも鬼","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":98.25,"end":101.25,"text":"今や頭の中のミュージックのせいで あなたの話は一向に聴き取れない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":102.83,"end":104.85,"text":"少しは真当なこと言って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":104.85,"end":107.85,"text":"回り出すターンテーブル ねえ全部忘れさせてよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":109.35,"end":112.35,"text":"だけど一体全体 如何して如何して 何故何故 はてな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":112.71000000000001,"end":115.71000000000001,"text":"不安定なカンテラ 消えない儘ね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":116.06,"end":119.06,"text":"あなた一口両舌食い違ってもう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":119.07,"end":121.21,"text":"冗談じゃあないないわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":121.21,"end":122.98,"text":"トウキョウ・シャンディ・ランデヴ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":122.98,"end":125.98,"text":"その時が来たって如何にもならないぜ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":126.95,"end":129.95,"text":"曖昧な本当なんてメランコリ化するだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":131.01,"end":134.01,"text":"あたしを今...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":149.34,"end":151.11,"text":"冗談じゃあないないわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":151.11,"end":152.77,"text":"トウキョウ・シャンディ・ランデヴ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":152.77,"end":155.77,"text":"その時が来たって如何にもならないぜ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":156.49,"end":158.1,"text":"不甲斐ないわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":158.1,"end":160.99,"text":"感情なんてランドリーで落とすだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":160.99,"end":163.72,"text":"あたしと確かめ合ってイエローマジック","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":163.72,"end":164.73,"text":"アイアイヤ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":164.73,"end":166.69,"text":"トウキョウ・シャンディ・ランデヴ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":166.69,"end":169.69,"text":"その時が来たって如何にもならないぜ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":171.25,"end":174.25,"text":"曖昧な本当なんてメランコリ化するだけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":174.84,"end":177.61,"text":"あたしをさあ掻攫って今テイクオンミー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":177.61,"end":180.61,"text":"イェス","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}